  triage:title "Connection<State> holds a redundant PhantomData marker alongside its live state field" ;
  triage:description "QA-AM-CRITICAL-PHASEEND (minor, rust-best-practices RBP-F003, still fully live -- not touched by the composition-stack fix): crates/atm-daemon-client/src/compatibility.rs:40-44's Connection<State> holds both a live state: State field and a redundant _marker: PhantomData<State> -- the live field already ties the type parameter to the struct, making the marker dead weight. Fix: drop the _marker field." ;
